      "text": "August Strindberg (1849–1912) pushed naturalism into the interior and then beyond it:"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODERN-DRAMA.md#014",
      "path": [
        "04-MODERN-DRAMA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
